RK3588 RKNPU INT8 Matmul Golden Vector
=======================================

This is a byte-for-byte hardware capture for C[1,32] = A[1,64] * B[32,64].
It was produced by TestOS on an Orange Pi 5 Plus (RK3588) on 2026-07-11.
The source capture completed with the NPU DPU interrupt and reported zero
mismatches against its logical reference.

